      <Desc>We have continue d our regular support to over 412 poor and children in Mexico and the Dominican Republic. Our support include food, medical care, housing, education and more. A majority of these children exist in extremely vulnerable conditions. Without our support, they would fall victims to a wide range of abuse and even early death.</Desc>
