        <Desc>We have continued our work with NGOs and churches in the Dominican Republic transform poor communities focused on a wide variety of community economic development projects, including farming, commuynity bakery, small business development and communitybased entreperneurial training. These projects are designed to give residents a opportunity to be economically self sufficient.</Desc>
